<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective on March 4.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.41     22.88	  4.59-9.83  4.86-10.09</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.41     22.88	  4.40-9.40  4.67-9.66</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.04     25.44	  12.21	12.60</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.04     25.44	  7.69	 7.99</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.25	  0.39	 0.40</p>
</text>
